# Raw video masters. The generator's originals are far too heavy to ship or to
# carry in git history (the "Our story" master is 9MB for 4.5s at 16 Mbps); the
# encoded derivatives beside them are what the site actually serves. Keep the
# masters locally or in shared storage so a re-encode is always possible.
VIDEOS/hf_*

# Image masters, same reasoning. The Attivo bath render is 3000x3500 and 2.86MB;
# what the site serves is the AVIF/WebP set beside it, topping out at 1440px and
# 100KB. Keep the master locally or in shared storage so a re-encode at a
# different size is always possible.
IMAGERY/attivo_freestand_bath_mixer__black_camera_png.jpg

# Mezzo Collective logo master, same reasoning again. 4500x4500 with the lockup
# floating in the middle of it, so about 84% of the file is transparent padding.
# What the site serves is mezzo-collective.webp/.png beside it: cropped to the
# ink at 228px wide, 4KB and 5KB. Keep the master locally or in shared storage.
IMAGERY/MEZZOC_LOGO-02.png
